It occured to me the other day while getting burned for the
1,000,000,000,000,000 time by Nethack that with the right starting
conditions I could get a great pet... maybe. Here's the scoop.

You need to start with a scroll of taming (it happens) and 2 altars. I
altar should be your alignment, the other not. Kill some monsters and
unsuccessfully convert the unaligned altar (seems to be an easy thing
to do if you use el wimpo monsters). Now go to the aligned (now
unaligned, since you just transgressed) altar and offer another
sacrifice. If you are lucky, your god will be so mad he will send some
kind of Angelic being (like a couatl) to take care of you. Read the
scroll of taming and presto, you now have a great pet for a level 1 or
2 character.

